u_k ∈ Z, 0 ≤ u_k ≤ 5 for each k ∈ J (integer between 0 and 5 inclusive). The depot’s auxiliary variable is fixed: u_d = 0.

Objective and direction
Minimize total flight time T = Σ_{i∈N} Σ_{j≠i} t_{ij} x_{ij}. The objective seeks the shortest possible tour (in minutes) that satisfies all constraints.

Constraints
1. Out‑degree constraint: Σ_{j≠i} x_{ij} = 1 for every i ∈ N (each location has exactly one outgoing edge).
